ᡝᡜᠲ᠐ᠧᡝᠲᢐᠼᢢᡴᢓᡔᡙᡡᡝᢢᡒᢟᠩᠱᢦ᠀ᡎᢁᡕᢏᡟᢠᠨᠨᡲᡞᢤ᠀ᡏ᠑ᠻᠲᢠᡡᢦᡙᠭᢠᡐᢠᡐᡎᢡ᠀ᠽᡴᠰᠽᡭᠵᡙᢞᡡᢛᡟᠼᡒᡔᠱᡭᡎ</div>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Skipton Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡱᢑᢦᢐᡐᠯᢑᡀᢏᢤᢂᠱᢐᢓᢤᠮᡗᡮᡗᠨᡲᢡᡳᡗᡳ᠒ᡏᠼᢑᢒᠳᠽᠿ᠐ᢀ᠒ᡒᠩᠿᢥᢠᢏᡱᠦᡒᠨᢢᡞᡡᡮ᠀ᡀᠩᡠᠯᠦᡕᠦᠧᡏᢏᠠᡝᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker28","name":"Westcking Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡎ᠐ᠽ᠐ᠠᡟᡠᠻᢀᢏᡍᠦᢦᡀᡯᡁᡱᠽᢒᢡᢞᠵᡲᡍᡔᡭᡮᠧᠩᡝᢂᡐᡓᢟᠿᡭᠨᡯᢛᠵᠦᡎᠪᠳᡭᢂ᠒᠑ᡠᡴᢡᢤᡙᢂᠠᠲᠭᢟ</div>"},{"id":"marker29","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker30","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker31","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker32","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only"},{"id":"marker33","name":"Calcerares Joust","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of the greats in Calcerares, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor"},{"id":"marker34","name":"Apes migration","legend":"A huge group of apes is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker35","name":"Dogs migration","legend":"A huge group of dogs is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker36","name":"Jackals migration","legend":"A huge group of jackals is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Camels migration","legend":"A huge group of camels is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Stapsea performance","legend":"A performance has been organised at Stapsea as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Interdimensional Rift","legend":"A rumoured interdimensional rift in this area is causing cracks in reality itself to form."},{"id":"regiment7-0","name":"🏹 1st (Gusen) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 204 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 1st (Gusen) Regiment is stationed in Bischenfeld. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 408 ME:\r\n— archers: 1548\r\n— cavalry: 226\r\n— artillery: 10\r\n— infantry: 1266."},{"id":"regiment7-1","name":"⚔️ 2nd (Winkwarton) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 202 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 2nd (Winkwarton) Regiment is stationed in Winkwarton Land. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 408 ME:\r\n— archers: 879\r\n— cavalry: 687\r\n— infantry: 1348\r\n— artillery: 8."},{"id":"regiment7-2","name":"⚔️ 3rd (Blechton) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 208 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 3rd (Blechton) Regiment is stationed in Blechton Region. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 408 ME:\r\n— infantry: 1164\r\n— archers: 739\r\n— cavalry: 493\r\n— artillery: 11."},{"id":"regiment7-3","name":"🏹 4th (Sulzgrafenia) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 203 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 4th (Sulzgrafenia) Regiment is stationed in Vohtallin. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 408 ME:\r\n— archers: 630\r\n— cavalry: 81\r\n— artillery: 14\r\n— infantry: 504."},{"id":"regiment7-4","name":"🏹 5th (Kambobi) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 200 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 5th (Kambobi) Regiment is stationed in Todttengen. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 408 ME:\r\n— archers: 443\r\n— cavalry: 50\r\n— artillery: 13\r\n— infantry: 346."},{"id":"regiment7-5","name":"⚔️ 6th (Winkwarton) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 206 Magel Era during the Diontitian Conquest. 6th (Winkwarton) 